            "review_title": "Review at Chill Dining - Grill & Seafood Oyster Bar",
            "review_text": "ZCC414\nSevenoaks, United Kingdom233 contributions\n0\nSky bar view fantastic and free! Also happy Hour till 8pm\nDec 2025 • Family\nThe Chilli and Sky Bar is next to the New World hotel at the top of a bank in District one.\nThe cocktails are great and happy hour is till 8pm. \nThe views over the city are fantastic perfect from sunset onwards. \nGets a bit more lively after 8.30pm depending on what you like. \nFree and a great find 😍\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2025",
